1. The Calculation Steps (Formulas):

    CIF Calculation (in ETB):

            
    CIF (ETB)=(FOB Value+Freight+Insurance)×NBE Exchange Rate
    CIF (ETB)=(FOB Value+Freight+Insurance)×NBE Exchange Rate

          

    Customs Duty (ቀረጥ):

            
    Customs Duty=CIF (ETB)×Duty Rate (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, or 35%)
    Customs Duty=CIF (ETB)×Duty Rate (0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, or 35%)

          

    Excise Tax (ኤክሳይስ ታክስ):

            
    Excise Tax=(CIF+Customs Duty)×Excise Rate (0% to 100+%)
    Excise Tax=(CIF+Customs Duty)×Excise Rate (0% to 100+%)

          

    VAT (የተጨማሪ እሴት ታክስ - 15%):

            
    VAT=(CIF+Customs Duty+Excise Tax)×15%
    VAT=(CIF+Customs Duty+Excise Tax)×15%

          

    Sur-Tax (ሰር ታክስ - 10%):

            
    Sur-Tax=(CIF+Customs Duty+Excise Tax)×10%
    Sur-Tax=(CIF+Customs Duty+Excise Tax)×10%

          


    (Applies to most commercial goods; exempt for certain essential foods/medicines).

    Withholding Tax (የቅድሚያ ግብር - 3%):

            
    Withholding=CIF (ETB)×3%
    Withholding=CIF (ETB)×3%

          

    Total Payable Tax:

            
    Total Tax=Duty+Excise+VAT+Sur-Tax+Withholding+Flat Admin/Scanning Fee (e.g., 200 ETB)
    Total Tax=Duty+Excise+VAT+Sur-Tax+Withholding+Flat Admin/Scanning Fee (e.g., 200 ETB)

          

2. Special Exemption Rules (Privilege Logic):

    Standard Commercial: All taxes apply.

    Diaspora Incentive (Duty-Free Privilege): Duty = 0, Excise = 0, Sur-Tax = 0; only VAT and flat administrative fees apply depending on the specific item directive.

    Investment Commission (EIC) Privilege: Duty and Sur-tax waived for approved capital goods / manufacturing raw materials.

    Diplomatic / UN: 100% tax exemption across all categories.